"%d pre-order was skipped because its release payment has already been taken."
msgid_plural ""
"%d pre-orders were skipped because their release payment has already been "
"taken."
msgstr[0] "%d előrendelés kimaradt, mert a megjelenéskor esedékes összeget már levonták."
msgstr[1] "%d előrendelés kimaradt, mert a megjelenéskor esedékes összeget már levonták."

#. translators: %d = error count
